flowchart LR
  L0[0 Tooling CI] --> L1[1 Bootstrap]
  L1 --> L2[2 Network]
  L2 --> L3[3 Platform]
  L3 --> L4[4 Private GKE]
  L4 --> L5[5 Addons / policy]
  L5 --> L6[6 Internal workloads]
  L6 --> L7[7 Staging delivery]
  L7 --> A1{Public-edge approval}
  A1 --> L8[8 Gateway / TLS / Armor]
  L7 --> A2{Production approval}
  A2 --> P[Promote verified release]
  L8 --> A3{Paid recovery approval}
  A3 --> L9[9 Backup / restore]
  L9 --> A4{Destructive-lab approval}
  A4 --> F1[Break / recover]
  F1 --> T[Evidence / teardown]
  F[Gate failure] --> D[Collect diagnostics]
  D --> R[Repair and retry same layer]
  D --> B[Destroy current layer]
